  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "煩勞<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳特地過來，\n謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了，<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "716952DE00100003110000FF01014F6059B372795730904E4F86FF0C000A8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E86FF0C00100002010000003002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳看一下這個。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B3770B4E004E0B9019500B3002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這是什麼？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019662F4EC09EBCFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "精靈球？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7CBE97487403FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這是瑪機雅娜，\n是500年以前由人類打造，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n從而誕生的寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019662F746A6A5F96C55A1CFF0C000A662F0035003000305E744EE5524D75314EBA985E62539020FF0C00100001BE00000A5F9E800C8A95751F76845BF653EF59223002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我們在都市開發的過程中發現了牠，\n但牠目前似乎是處於休眠狀態……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115011572890FD5E02958B767C7684904E7A0B4E2D767C73FE4E867260FF0C000A4F46726076EE524D4F3C4E4E662F865565BC4F11772072C0614B20262026001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "若要讓牠甦醒，\n必須將能量傳輸到牠體內的裝置。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "82E589818B93726075269192FF0C000A5FC598085C0780FD91CF50B38F38523072609AD45167768488DD7F6E3002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而那將會需要有\n瑪機雅娜專用的超級石。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C90A35C076703970089816709000A746A6A5F96C55A1C5C08752876848D857D1A77F33002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這部分雖然已經委託\nAZ幫忙製作了，但……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n超級石會由我們闊星公司預備。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "901990E8520696D671365DF27D9359D48A17000A0041005A5E6B5FD988FD4F5C4E86FF0C4F462026202600100001BE01000A8D857D1A77F3670375316211501195CA661F516C53F8981050993002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，可以請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫忙準備\n提煉超級石所需的<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>超級碎片<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>嗎？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我們一共需要<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>999個<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 22,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C53EF4EE58ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B5FD96E965099000A63D071498D857D1A77F362409700768400100002FF0000068D857D1A788E724700100002FF00000055CEFF1F00100001BE00000A621150114E0051719700898100100002FF000006003900390039500B00100002FF0000003002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "處於休眠狀態的瑪機雅娜。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "865565BC4F11772072C0614B7684746A6A5F96C55A1C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫忙準備\n提煉超級石所需的<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>超級碎片<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我們一共需要<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>999個<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 22,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B5FD96E965099000A63D071498D857D1A77F362409700768400100002FF0000068D857D1A788E724700100002FF000000300200100001BE00000A621150114E0051719700898100100002FF000006003900390039500B00100002FF0000003002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳送來超級碎片了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B390014F868D857D1A788E72474E8655CEFF1F001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請收下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB65364E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唉呀？\n是發生了什麼問題嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55095440FF1F000A662F767C751F4E864EC09EBC554F984C55CEFF1F001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>交出了\n999個超級碎片！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000004EA451FA4E86000A003900390039500B8D857D1A788E7247FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "感謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳幫忙收集。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "611F8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E6B5FD9653696C63002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "接下來，就由我們這邊\n來為瑪機雅娜提煉超級石吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "63A54E0B4F86FF0C5C317531621150119019908A000A4F8670BA746A6A5F96C55A1C63D071498D857D1A77F354273002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這是瑪機雅娜專用的超級石，\n瑪機雅娜進化石。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019662F746A6A5F96C55A1C5C08752876848D857D1A77F3FF0C000A746A6A5F96C55A1C9032531677F33002001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，請從超級環的鑰石\n把能量傳送給瑪機雅娜吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBCFF0C8ACB5F9E8D857D1A74B07684947077F3000A628A80FD91CF50B390017D66746A6A5F96C55A1C54273002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……噗咻。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "20262026565754BB30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎啊！\n牠甦醒了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE554AFF01000A7260752691924E863002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真是太好了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F662F592A597D4E8620262026001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n一直在沉睡的瑪機雅娜牠現在甦醒了，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳帶牠去體驗這個美麗的世界吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A4E0076F457286C8977617684746A6A5F96C55A1C726073FE5728752691924E86FF0C00100001BE00000A8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E36726053BB9AD49A579019500B7F8E9E9776844E16754C54273002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>得到了\n瑪機雅娜！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000005F9752304E86000A746A6A5F96C55A1CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "唉呀……\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的盒子是滿的呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5509544020262026000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3768476D25B50662F6EFF768454623002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳多多照顧\n瑪機雅娜了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3162DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B3591A591A71679867000A746A6A5F96C55A1C4E863002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也請收下這個超級石吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F8ACB65364E0B9019500B8D857D1A77F354273002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n包含<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>在內，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n今後還要請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳多多照顧了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 13,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A5305542B00100002018B000157285167FF0C00100001BE00000A4ECA5F8C908489818ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B3591A591A716798674E863002001000020114000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當有了一份與人連結的感覺，\n那就會化為對這座城市的一份感情呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "757667094E864E004EFD82074EBA90237D507684611F89BAFF0C000A90A35C316703531670BA5C0D90195EA757CE5E0276844E004EFD611F60C554623002001000020114000D0000",
